  (descr "Carrier-side land pattern for the modulo dev board Rev 0.3 (40.64 x 17.78 mm, castellated edge pads), soldered component side up. Origin = dev board top-left corner, same coordinates as the Rev 0.3 user guide. Pads: 1.3 mm under the board + 1.5 mm outside for the iron, 1.6 mm wide, no paste. Includes the SWD cutout under J2 (Edge.Cuts). Keepouts (antenna, TP1, USB-C legs) are drawn on Dwgs.User; the rule areas are placed on the board.")
